":{"term":"책임자","audio":"/audio/34f0309a2e61fbea2aed.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"오라고","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오라고","audio":"/audio/3a0f1ed7580815f00be6.mp3"}},{"text":"하세요.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하세요","audio":"/audio/20c70a963b62c0806108.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"食物，食品","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"可供人们吃喝的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"味，味道","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"用舌头接触食物等时得到的感觉。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"34f0309a2e61fbea","term":"책임자","zh":"负责人","audio":"/audio/34f0309a2e61fbea2aed.mp3","entryId":"72042","definition":"对某件事情负有责任或要承担责任的人。","pronunciation":["채김자"]},{"id":"